 =?UTF-8?q?=20=C2=AB=E2=8B=AF=C2=BB=20beside=20the=20take's=20title=20open?=
 =?UTF-8?q?s=20its=20menu;=20Regenerate=20leads=20Make=20again?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The take's card no longer shows its rows of buttons by default (the take's menu holds them since 1483); «⋯» beside the title opens that menu, whose last row, «The card's buttons», brings them back (kept in this browser) and takes them off again. «⋯» ends the head's row, ▶ stays first. Regenerate with a new seed leads Make again ›; on several checked takes it is that group's one row.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
